notes.content:
The second part of the update includes:
- Unique hand skin for each character;
- Added 2 starting weapons (Revolver and Deagle);
- A machine gun has been added;
- A machine gun has been added;
- Changed the animation of the zombie attack;
- Fixed a bug on the sands map
- The flashlight turns on and off with the "K" key
- The damage system has been improved depending on the type of weapon
- Map optimization
- Environment sounds have been corrected
- Fixed a bug with aiming
- A turret has been added, but it is not active now, it needs to be improved

Hi!
The update will be divided into 3 parts. 
The update includes:
- The game is from the 1st person;
- 2 new maps that are great for playing 2-4 players;
- New shooting effects, sounds, bullet animations;
- 7 types of weapons
- New menu;
- New music in the menu;
- New lobby;
- Improved optimization;
- A flashlight has been added, but for now it is always on.
------------------
The 3rd map, 5 new weapons, 2 turrets, grenades, melee attacks have already been added to the game, but they will not be active in this update.

All new functionality will be enabled and released by mid-January

https://i.postimg.cc/G2WQkknR/screen1.png
https://i.postimg.cc/tCSsw97Z/screen2.png
https://i.postimg.cc/SRKMYRJ4/screen3.png

Hello friends!
In general, the update is ready, a lot of new things have been done and I hope the project will come to life.
From the main point it is:
- Now the 1-person shooter, honestly, I really liked it, it looks clearly nicer;
- New weapons, remaking the sounds of old ones, bullet effects and more;
- 3 new maps: military base in the forest, desert and city;
- Zombies now use different animations, new sounds;
- Turrets with a minigun and a flamethrower, of course you can add a rocket launcher and a laser, but I didn't really like them;
- Optimization, now FPS is much more stable;
- Redesigned menu and lobby
I haven't decided when to release it yet, as well as the format. I think that every week there will be a patch with new content and bug fixes.
